{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "fbb0fb129a40b0b1d81032362d3e2c941f4bac77f053991e64c649dcb55d4ce8", "ja": "夜のはじまり", "zh": "夜晚的开端", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ef50c8e63c1326fbe78f42efd71eea7b300c90d5fec0a527038f4043df9519e5", "ja": "美咲から劇の内容を聞いた恵美は、千鶴と\n朋花と一緒に、プロデューサーにドッキリを\n仕掛ける。ネタばらし後、莉緒も合流。\n新ユニット『夜想令嬢』は、劇場初となる\n演劇中心の公演のミーティングを行う。", "zh": "惠美听美咲说了舞台剧的内容，\n找了千鹤和朋花一起要吓制作人一跳。\n谜底揭晓之后，莉绪也来了。\n新团体『夜想千金』，\n为剧场首次以戏剧为主的公演召开会议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6bddb93d664bf98b1ff7ea252ccecf5d2166157f960c9479217eac6f51ee5c16", "ja": "（さて、これから『昏き星、遠い月』の\n初ミーティングだ！　張り切って行こう！）", "zh": "（待会就要开『昏暗之星，遥远之月』的第一次会议了！\n我要全力以赴！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "38e021382aba1de92c49db50d81cb212a5edae8efba2eed9b7144c1e66cd2be5", "ja": "うん……？　電気がついていない。\nみんな、まだ来ていないのかな？", "zh": "嗯……？灯没有开。\n大家都还没来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "7c8af006858d8a04d1cbefa52c0568ac75de9bbfb6d2f5381465a4b127827cc0", "ja": "ううっ……。", "zh": "呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "e47eadd7fd27437f8ad91a945583e995adc2596480681a566f93341d0e0f240a", "ja": "えっ……め、恵美？\nど、どうしたんだ。体調でも悪いのか？", "zh": "咦……惠、惠美？\n怎、怎么了，你身体不舒服吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "db13e9f7fc1d924800452282888d99f3503433001e02bfbee785bd236c79f6b5", "ja": "ぷ、プロデューサー、気をつけて……。\n劇場に……劇場に、吸血鬼が……。", "zh": "制、制作人，小心……\n剧场里……剧场里有吸血鬼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "fc94dff5f3329997aae6b60a3e3735b99e08e2cd23a1c3330abed803e5fb05d5", "ja": "？　吸血鬼って、どういう……。\nいや、とにかく病院に……。", "zh": "嗯？吸血鬼是什么意思……？\n不对，总之得先送你去医院……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "60bc400233466d794203111209e47b7ee56bbb06cca9d59b13f2c0711bb57cf7", "ja": "……動かないでください～……。", "zh": "……不要动喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c5859e0bebedfc27b66c27895a431b1c1e94d5d0a1ca7eeebc7e8474e504bd2a", "ja": "なっ……！", "zh": "什……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0c3b42d1bd7352f11a894d8f3cba519b7d44cce169a2b5dc2a611eb7ad5b1434", "ja": "（背後から、すさまじいプレッシャーを感じる……\nう、動けない……これは、一体……？）", "zh": "（背后传来一阵强烈的压迫感……\n身、身体动弹不得……这到底是……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a6a0b210c3ded2a04851789dae8fcddd6c8a042707561a71cca3f1e1e893bbf5", "ja": "まさか……これが、恵美の言っていた吸血鬼……！？", "zh": "难道……这就是惠美说的吸血鬼……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "17f2888ff5671e12a8b8008a8289b71960b9d99cfa7e21d3714799e49cfae984", "ja": "そのとおりです～。\nその子の血は、私がいただきました～。", "zh": "没错～\n我吸了这女孩的鲜血～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "9a90ad76a3ca6d285bc41cfeda58335c210dcf7ff85fe988abd46c4752550c55", "ja": "朋花！？　朋花が吸血鬼に……そんな！\nしっかりするんだ、朋花！", "zh": "朋花！？朋花变成吸血鬼了……怎么会这样！\n你醒醒啊，朋花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1012_031tom", "source_sha256": "1f544b351f3f8d69e173e23c015b16aca37bd476020d459ad36c2ec3d1a5e2ed", "ja": "今度は、アナタの番ですよ～？\nうふふ、おいしそうな首ですね～……。", "zh": "接下来轮到你了喔～\n呵呵，你的脖子看起来真美味～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "7d015569fc69615ea3aadd78390f6cac5d153a96bb0cff6b2bbdf23c2adfc0a6", "ja": "くっ、俺はここで死ぬのか？\n……いや、そんなわけにはいかない！", "zh": "唔，我会死在这里吗？\n……不，这怎么可以！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1014_p", "source_sha256": "7c4718b4f5a6c65a98d7c2e94307294d30037ba65c34add18195bc669bb8508b", "ja": "俺にはまだ、やることがある！\nそれに、恵美と朋花をこのままにはしておけない！", "zh": "我还有非做不可的事！\n而且我也不能就这样放着惠美和朋花不管！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1015_031tom", "source_sha256": "215a3851090041ce4355f2b8dcb7727490c7d796fd4f0ddb58a181484407f50b", "ja": "……驚きました～。この私のプレッシャーを\nはね退けた人間は、初めてですよ～♪", "zh": "……真是惊人～\n我还是第一次遇到有人类可以抵抗我的压迫感～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "38e970df75c0e79fcbe90daba3b2000bbe9de5519279f4a85dadbbe6a2a34997", "ja": "ほめてあげましょう～♪\nですが、これならどうですか～？", "zh": "就夸奖你一下吧～♪\n不过，要是换作这样呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1017_p", "source_sha256": "823c79f17bf940c74eff1e627ad1fef93f138022acd4afc661b98525721ec248", "ja": "ぐっ！　さっきよりも、さらに重く……！\nこ、ここまでか……すまない、ふたりとも……。", "zh": "唔！压迫感比刚刚更重了……！\n我、我只能撑到这里了吗……抱歉，两位……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1018_038chz", "source_sha256": "4ad7ab6047e030b3de84d232613ce25a9493b6f702afc5a6e8f5a1ff389c6d19", "ja": "簡単に諦めないでくださいまし、\n{$P$}！", "zh": "请不要轻易放弃，\n{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "2b64122fa7df391a0c41c4f0f985b725967e873735fac1d718bbaee753523a6d", "ja": "こ、この高貴な声は……！？", "zh": "这、这个高贵的声音是……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1020_038chz", "source_sha256": "4d83b47d6303360aa8f4957cf78042c3c668d5d1be30cec65dbeebf343f14de1", "ja": "そう、わたくしですわ！\n助けにまいりましたわよ、{$P$}！", "zh": "没错，正是本小姐！\n本小姐来救你了，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1021_p", "source_sha256": "c0e9a3d5e0a64bfdae5de17368d5af22fe4a7c122f9f1af5feb481ea44fe6857", "ja": "千鶴さん、逃げてください！　相手は吸血鬼です！\n劇場にいるみんなにも、早く逃げるように……。", "zh": "千鹤，你快逃！对方是吸血鬼！\n还有剧场的大家，叫他们快逃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1022_038chz", "source_sha256": "5f58e351ca1c606e95617dc1be34ba13b0a561611f9daad2271c8701cbc961a9", "ja": "その必要はありませんわ！\nセレブとは、世を忍ぶ仮の姿……。", "zh": "没有这个必要！\n名流只是我在世间的伪装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1023_038chz", "source_sha256": "26595a80fe786d1063b7f18fb836e4fa1fca461bbebf212e9ebaa50dfe31a97b", "ja": "その正体は……\nセレブヴァンパイアハンター・マスカレード！", "zh": "而真正的身分是……\n名流吸血鬼猎人‧假面舞会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "3b2a26aac3f646a67fa95715474f0ba950333b73b21ea683682fc1c92526f44d", "ja": "セレブヴァンパイアハンター・マスカレード！？", "zh": "名流吸血鬼猎人‧假面舞会！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1025_020meg", "source_sha256": "172d7fe8d3f8b918ba62cc4b170dc214ae6221469ecd8747e16657dc78024318", "ja": "……あっははは！　も～、千鶴！\nセレブヴァンパイアハンターって何～？", "zh": "……啊哈哈哈！真是的～千鹤！\n名流吸血鬼猎人是什么啦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1026_p", "source_sha256": "062e67ef70c430866ecccae2e4428c56ffe4978dca12db049557a516773ae1ad", "ja": "め、恵美！　目が覚めたのか……よかった。\nケガはないか？　大丈夫か？", "zh": "惠、惠美！你醒了吗……太好了。\n你有没有受伤？还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1027_020meg", "source_sha256": "213b4d0297ee14d5896cf8819851b1aaeaae8c0a025f03075e634cbc7b26a7ff", "ja": "ヘーキヘーキ！　{$P$}、\n心配してくれてアリガトね♪", "zh": "没事没事！\n{$P$}，谢谢你担心我♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1028_038chz", "source_sha256": "9250ec8637ee6dfc62190b5e7175d9cdecc921ddc9da81ba2f032a104da5c5cb", "ja": "わたくしも、セレブヴァンパイアハンターではなく\nただのセレブですわ。ご安心くださいまし！", "zh": "本小姐也不是名流吸血鬼猎人，\n只是个普通的名流，敬请放心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1029_031tom", "source_sha256": "61dfdac0b97cd8c66776634a85f50cf6c0660a2b250caf3e758dad0661fa9e2d", "ja": "もちろん私も、吸血鬼ではなく、聖母ですよ～♪", "zh": "当然，我也不是吸血鬼，是圣母～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "3e9715a5b7a66190a9cb4c48cad57e63c87244b2a96c39201758c687d2ebe91f", "ja": "そ、そうだったのか。つまり……\n俺もそろそろ、普通にしていいんだな？", "zh": "这、这样吗。\n也就是说……我现在可以恢复正常了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1031_020meg", "source_sha256": "e2cb67c5a69111f57f3339b90ae103bbb4cfac97ab6f8214568ff7f2f4239022", "ja": "そゆこと～。ねね、面白かった？", "zh": "没错～你觉得好玩吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1032_p", "source_sha256": "6e0631def2675373c9fe8e7d181f5a6dbbfe44593aa628fff8324a3b52e3b99d", "ja": "はは、そうだな。それにしても、このタイミングで\n吸血鬼ってことは、もしかして……？", "zh": "哈哈，这个嘛。\n话说回来，在这个时候扮起吸血鬼，难道……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1033_020meg", "source_sha256": "8fa2a6b444e39f986dc8ab13cc56daf204a3ee70721b6eac7354f1b81e0412e4", "ja": "うんっ、一足先に、美咲から今度の劇の話、\n聞いちゃったんだよね～！", "zh": "嗯，我们已经先一步听美咲说了，\n关于这次舞台剧的事情啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1034_020meg", "source_sha256": "907a65210d06fa089c4d3b1a7877c37ecb621b5cc1d99935af10519eab67529c", "ja": "それで試しに、自分達の役をやってみない？って、\n千鶴と朋花を誘ってみたんだけど……。", "zh": "于是我就找了千鹤跟朋花，\n问她们要不要先试着演看看自己的角色……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1035_038chz", "source_sha256": "ca50a5c3113e25c666fe7e1ad44603ab180c48a07ba29c9160d23984ffaac538", "ja": "恵美は人間で、わたくしはヴァンパイアハンター。\nそして、朋花は吸血鬼を演じると聞きましたわ。", "zh": "听美咲说，惠美演人类，本小姐是吸血鬼猎人，\n然后朋花是演吸血鬼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1036_p", "source_sha256": "3e4c28e7cecba00ab556f66a617fd3d766783aa6d1aed98a38fd15c5ad6208f2", "ja": "なるほど、うっすらとは聞いていたんだな。\nそれじゃ……。", "zh": "原来如此，你们已经大致听说了啊。\n既然这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1037_se", "source_sha256": "ab891e62578da72bb10899bd83d3ea003f20decf24b49e30ef768308acd59625", "ja": "カチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1038_046rio", "source_sha256": "e7b93813bec257905d3588bfe87a1b88b3f26f596bd643dadc1e16e00da6eece", "ja": "あら、みんな、もうおそろい？\n早いのね、ウフフ。", "zh": "哎呀，大家都已经到了？\n你们好早来喔，呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1039_p", "source_sha256": "4eeab1fe22ace471a3e3a18c73bb8b57f80950b3461f4d55bb02fdb57fe6c3cb", "ja": "お疲れさま、莉緒。これでメインキャストは\n全員そろったな。それじゃ、改めて……。", "zh": "辛苦了，莉绪。这样主要演员都到齐了。\n那我正式宣布……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1040_p", "source_sha256": "2c187b487ab0c0289f16b2dc7d74e98a66e96d9fb1f1fe43a01f30774fc7a083", "ja": "次の公演について、ミーティングを始めよう！", "zh": "现在开始进行下次公演的会议！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1041_020meg", "source_sha256": "8e4e6590a3413542c29ec1fac688e499aa9324d67e396b377f0ba1256e69328a", "ja": "アタシは男装してる女の子の、エドガーって役ね。\nオッケー。やれるだけやってみるよ！", "zh": "我演的是一个女扮男装，叫做艾德嘉的角色吧。\n没问题，我会尽力去尝试的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1042_031tom", "source_sha256": "18a9653257fc835c5bf751b0b33fa9ead5c0855ca6b04df3955cf3515ee44865", "ja": "私が演じるのは……まるで女の子のような\n男の子の吸血鬼、クリスティーナですか～。", "zh": "我演的是……\n像女孩子一样的吸血鬼男孩，克利丝汀吗～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1043_031tom", "source_sha256": "ecbafdf893ec6b0e1b8aab5ff445026db7eb7d07cab89a6684bc3ea822905a33", "ja": "うふっ。背後に複雑な設定があって、\nなかなか演じがいがありそうですね～♪", "zh": "呵呵，这个角色有复杂的背景设定，\n感觉很值得挑战饰演～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1044_038chz", "source_sha256": "f8eede48b60b6c0702b7d3a4d019ca1690516bf7e27a0b91268069322ead014c", "ja": "わたくしは、騎士でヴァンパイアハンター。\nアレクサンドラを演じるのですね。", "zh": "本小姐饰演的是骑士兼吸血鬼猎人，\n亚历山大是嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1045_038chz", "source_sha256": "065607a7bac3c3619f2b9f1fd8499765c09fa5326b1c158393ceeddc62f35622", "ja": "気高いアレクサンドラを見事に演じきってみせますわ！\nおーっほっほっほっ……ゲホッ、ゲホッ……。", "zh": "本小姐会完美诠释高尚的亚历山大的！\n哦～呵呵呵……咳、咳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1046_046rio", "source_sha256": "ecc78ca42db51b044b2add5b93ff2c929daf2f996c4e8e86df4b72802a26454a", "ja": "で、私は辺境伯夫人……悪女エレオノーラの役ね。\nいいじゃない、悪女。燃えてきたわ！", "zh": "然后我的角色是藩侯夫人……坏女人艾蕾欧诺拉吧？\n真不错呢，坏女人。我都热血沸腾了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1047_046rio", "source_sha256": "96413410050fa005fa22d9430358f24cc715a3a9ddf1f84030780e7295ed8c42", "ja": "だって、古今東西、\n悪女といえばモテモテだもの！", "zh": "因为古今中外的坏女人，\n每个都很有男人缘嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1048_p", "source_sha256": "c1eadfd3419890886ef69e6b4f02eda795646dde8c7fd49ff1db1f8efddbf377", "ja": "そうとは限らないと思うが……。\nまあ、やる気があって助かるよ。", "zh": "我想也不完全是这样……\n算了，只要有干劲就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1049_p", "source_sha256": "76e43d505c4c8bcc5b269a3c634b52fa88298d3e2ca6f2ecc2396c0ae7224d24", "ja": "今回の『昏き星、遠い月』は、演劇がメインだ。\n劇場としても初めての、新たな試みになる……。", "zh": "这次的『昏暗之星，遥远之月』以戏剧为主。\n对剧场来说是前所未有的全新挑战……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_01_1050_p", "source_sha256": "3ad637d2db5b5cb0e134555cb3ea75e6d328e0e579396c2b005b346839c73010", "ja": "これまでにないダークな雰囲気の劇になるが、\nみんななら演じきれる！　頑張っていこう！", "zh": "虽然是之前没有尝试过的黑暗风格戏剧，\n但是我想大家一定能发挥出精湛的演技！加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
